[
 {
  "text": "Every sneeze teleports you.",
  "start": 0.0,
  "end": 1.48,
  "startFrame": 0,
  "endFrame": 44,
  "words": [
   0,
   3
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "Last week I sneezed once, and I ended up in the middle of a frozen forest, holding a cat.",
  "start": 1.78,
  "end": 6.2,
  "startFrame": 53,
  "endFrame": 186,
  "words": [
   4,
   22
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "Let me explain.",
  "start": 6.46,
  "end": 7.0,
  "startFrame": 194,
  "endFrame": 210,
  "words": [
   23,
   25
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "In this world, every time you sneeze, you teleport to whatever you were thinking about.",
  "start": 7.26,
  "end": 10.92,
  "startFrame": 218,
  "endFrame": 328,
  "words": [
   26,
   40
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "Whatever you're holding comes with you.",
  "start": 11.12,
  "end": 12.52,
  "startFrame": 334,
  "endFrame": 376,
  "words": [
   41,
   46
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "So pepper is sold only with a prescription.",
  "start": 12.72,
  "end": 14.72,
  "startFrame": 382,
  "endFrame": 442,
  "words": [
   47,
   54
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "In spring, airports are empty, because why fly when you can just sniff a flower?",
  "start": 15.06,
  "end": 18.76,
  "startFrame": 452,
  "endFrame": 563,
  "words": [
   55,
   69
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "Bless you means goodbye.",
  "start": 19.04,
  "end": 20.2,
  "startFrame": 571,
  "endFrame": 606,
  "words": [
   70,
   73
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "My grandma once sneezed while holding her couch.",
  "start": 20.56,
  "end": 22.5,
  "startFrame": 617,
  "endFrame": 675,
  "words": [
   74,
   81
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "She landed in Paris, still sitting on it.",
  "start": 22.76,
  "end": 24.7,
  "startFrame": 683,
  "endFrame": 741,
  "words": [
   82,
   89
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "My dad sneezed thinking about a sandwich.",
  "start": 24.84,
  "end": 26.64,
  "startFrame": 745,
  "endFrame": 799,
  "words": [
   90,
   96
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "He woke up inside a sandwich shop in Ohio, wearing pajamas.",
  "start": 26.87,
  "end": 29.74,
  "startFrame": 806,
  "endFrame": 892,
  "words": [
   97,
   107
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "And at my uncle's wedding, the groom sneezed during the vows while thinking about his ex.",
  "start": 30.1,
  "end": 34.0,
  "startFrame": 903,
  "endFrame": 1020,
  "words": [
   108,
   123
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "There was no wedding.",
  "start": 34.3,
  "end": 34.96,
  "startFrame": 1029,
  "endFrame": 1049,
  "words": [
   124,
   127
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "I'm Sam.",
  "start": 35.24,
  "end": 35.64,
  "startFrame": 1057,
  "endFrame": 1069,
  "words": [
   128,
   129
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "I have the worst allergies in town.",
  "start": 35.94,
  "end": 37.42,
  "startFrame": 1078,
  "endFrame": 1123,
  "words": [
   130,
   136
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "Cats, dust, flowers, everything.",
  "start": 37.72,
  "end": 39.72,
  "startFrame": 1132,
  "endFrame": 1192,
  "words": [
   137,
   140
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "I've taken pills every morning since I was four.",
  "start": 40.04,
  "end": 42.08,
  "startFrame": 1201,
  "endFrame": 1262,
  "words": [
   141,
   149
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "The year I sneezed thinking about a giraffe and woke up in a zoo in Kenya.",
  "start": 42.32,
  "end": 45.56,
  "startFrame": 1270,
  "endFrame": 1367,
  "words": [
   150,
   165
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "I haven't sneezed since.",
  "start": 45.88,
  "end": 46.82,
  "startFrame": 1376,
  "endFrame": 1405,
  "words": [
   166,
   169
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "Then one night, my little sister Mia chased a stray cat into the woods.",
  "start": 47.14,
  "end": 50.6,
  "startFrame": 1414,
  "endFrame": 1518,
  "words": [
   170,
   183
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "A snowstorm hit.",
  "start": 50.9,
  "end": 51.72,
  "startFrame": 1527,
  "endFrame": 1552,
  "words": [
   184,
   186
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "The search teams couldn't find her.",
  "start": 51.94,
  "end": 53.28,
  "startFrame": 1558,
  "endFrame": 1598,
  "words": [
   187,
   192
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "Nobody could.",
  "start": 53.54,
  "end": 54.1,
  "startFrame": 1606,
  "endFrame": 1623,
  "words": [
   193,
   194
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "But I didn't need to know where she was.",
  "start": 54.3,
  "end": 55.9,
  "startFrame": 1629,
  "endFrame": 1677,
  "words": [
   195,
   203
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "I just needed to think about her and sneeze.",
  "start": 55.9,
  "end": 58.26,
  "startFrame": 1677,
  "endFrame": 1748,
  "words": [
   204,
   212
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "My pills were still working.",
  "start": 58.52,
  "end": 59.52,
  "startFrame": 1756,
  "endFrame": 1786,
  "words": [
   213,
   217
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "My nose was dead.",
  "start": 59.78,
  "end": 60.74,
  "startFrame": 1793,
  "endFrame": 1822,
  "words": [
   218,
   221
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "So I broke into grandma's secret pepper drawer, opened the whole grinder, and breathed it in like a vacuum cleaner.",
  "start": 61.12,
  "end": 65.86,
  "startFrame": 1834,
  "endFrame": 1976,
  "words": [
   222,
   241
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "My eyes watered.",
  "start": 66.2,
  "end": 66.92,
  "startFrame": 1986,
  "endFrame": 2008,
  "words": [
   242,
   244
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "My brain screamed.",
  "start": 67.18,
  "end": 68.2,
  "startFrame": 2015,
  "endFrame": 2046,
  "words": [
   245,
   247
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "I thought about Mia's face as hard as I could.",
  "start": 68.56,
  "end": 70.66,
  "startFrame": 2057,
  "endFrame": 2120,
  "words": [
   248,
   257
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "Achoo!",
  "start": 71.04,
  "end": 71.34,
  "startFrame": 2131,
  "endFrame": 2140,
  "words": [
   258,
   258
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "Snow.",
  "start": 71.7,
  "end": 72.0,
  "startFrame": 2151,
  "endFrame": 2160,
  "words": [
   259,
   259
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "Darkness.",
  "start": 72.38,
  "end": 72.64,
  "startFrame": 2171,
  "endFrame": 2179,
  "words": [
   260,
   260
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "And right in front of me, Mia, shivering, hugging that stray cat.",
  "start": 73.06,
  "end": 76.14,
  "startFrame": 2192,
  "endFrame": 2284,
  "words": [
   261,
   272
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "She smiled.",
  "start": 76.38,
  "end": 76.9,
  "startFrame": 2291,
  "endFrame": 2307,
  "words": [
   273,
   274
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "I knew you'd come.",
  "start": 77.18,
  "end": 77.86,
  "startFrame": 2315,
  "endFrame": 2336,
  "words": [
   275,
   278
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "But I had no pepper left.",
  "start": 78.12,
  "end": 79.34,
  "startFrame": 2344,
  "endFrame": 2380,
  "words": [
   279,
   284
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "No way home.",
  "start": 79.64,
  "end": 80.22,
  "startFrame": 2389,
  "endFrame": 2407,
  "words": [
   285,
   287
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "Then I looked at the cat.",
  "start": 80.5,
  "end": 81.56,
  "startFrame": 2415,
  "endFrame": 2447,
  "words": [
   288,
   293
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "I'm allergic to cats.",
  "start": 81.78,
  "end": 82.86,
  "startFrame": 2453,
  "endFrame": 2486,
  "words": [
   294,
   297
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "I grabbed Mia, grabbed the cat, and pushed my face right into its fur.",
  "start": 83.06,
  "end": 86.28,
  "startFrame": 2492,
  "endFrame": 2588,
  "words": [
   298,
   311
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "I thought about our kitchen.",
  "start": 86.58,
  "end": 87.42,
  "startFrame": 2597,
  "endFrame": 2623,
  "words": [
   312,
   316
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "Achoo!",
  "start": 87.84,
  "end": 88.16,
  "startFrame": 2635,
  "endFrame": 2645,
  "words": [
   317,
   317
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "We landed right on the kitchen table, in front of Mom.",
  "start": 88.38,
  "end": 90.56,
  "startFrame": 2651,
  "endFrame": 2717,
  "words": [
   318,
   328
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "Mom cried and hugged us so hard I could barely breathe.",
  "start": 90.9,
  "end": 93.6,
  "startFrame": 2727,
  "endFrame": 2808,
  "words": [
   329,
   339
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "We kept the cat.",
  "start": 93.96,
  "end": 94.56,
  "startFrame": 2819,
  "endFrame": 2837,
  "words": [
   340,
   343
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "Now I sneeze forty times a day.",
  "start": 94.78,
  "end": 96.34,
  "startFrame": 2843,
  "endFrame": 2890,
  "words": [
   344,
   350
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "Yesterday, I thought about pizza.",
  "start": 96.6,
  "end": 97.82,
  "startFrame": 2898,
  "endFrame": 2935,
  "words": [
   351,
   355
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "I'm writing this from Italy.",
  "start": 98.16,
  "end": 99.0,
  "startFrame": 2945,
  "endFrame": 2970,
  "words": [
   356,
   360
  ]
 }
]